From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Spindler <richard@lateralblast.com.au>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:50:24 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] hpn-ssh: HPN-SSH 18.12.0 merged into OpenSSH master

The HPN-SSH changes (rapier1/hpn-ssh 2c7cc5554, HPN-SSH 18.12.0 on OpenSSH 10.6)
as one patch on openssh/openssh-portable master (3c6ec4c63), which has the
OpenSSH commits made after the ones that HPN-SSH has. It is the result of
"git merge" of the one into the other in a scratch clone, with these conflicts
resolved: the page headers of the renamed manual pages (OpenSSH's text, HPN's
names), "tun-connection" in serverloop.c (OpenSSH's name), and .github, which
is HPN's.

To take a newer HPN-SSH or OpenSSH, merge again in a clone of
openssh-portable and regenerate this patch; see "Patches" in the README.
